# Confidential: the deploy manifest/summary carry per-cell performance numbers
# (selection-efficiency, latencies). They must NOT be committed to the branch.
# Only the model parameters are tracked here: one .mosaic.bin per library-logic
# file (named after its Tensile logic stem) plus the mosaic_index that maps
# stems -> binaries. The manifest and summary live in the pipeline run output
# (gemmaiperf/.../runs/<run>/).
*.manifest.json
*.summary.txt
